        "answer": {
          "short": "Matching groups: $4x,\\ 2x+2x,\\ x\\times4$; $2x\\times2x,\\ 4x^2,\\ x^2+x^2+x^2+x^2$. No match: $x^4$, $2x^2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2x+2x&=4x\\\\x\\times4&=4x\\\\2x\\times2x&=(2\\times2)(x\\times x)=4x^2\\\\x^2+x^2+x^2+x^2&=4x^2\\end{align*}$$\nThe expressions $x^4$ and $2x^2$ have no match.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
